## Success Criteria

### Pydantic Modernization
✅ All models use Pydantic 2.x syntax  
✅ `model_config` replaces [Config](file:///Users/alexzh/ableton-mcp/tests/test_agentic_workflow.py#166-197) class  
✅ `@field_validator` replaces `@validator`  
✅ `@model_validator(mode='after')` for cross-field validation  
✅ Version control structure in place  
✅ CHANGELOG.md created and documented  
✅ pydantic-settings evaluated and used appropriately

### Phase 1-5 Implementation
✅ Test validator with modern patterns  
✅ Agent validator with modern patterns  
✅ Track models with modern patterns  
✅ All validators generate reports  
✅ Migration paths documented

**Total Estimated Time**: 5 days
- Day 1: Modern Pydantic patterns + versioning setup
- Days 2-3: Test & Agent validators
- Days 4-5: Track structure + migration
